  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding from OCR of scanned AK Fexmid Criteria Version 1; Last updated 06/24/09. Source PDF is image-only (HP MFP); text recovered via tesseract 2026-09-27. OCR typo 'Smg' corrected to 5mg.",
    "effective_date uses Last updated 2009-06-24 (replaces ingestion stub 2024-06-01).",
    "Tablet strength 7.5mg. Indication: adjunct to rest/PT for relief of muscle spasm associated with acute, painful musculoskeletal conditions.",
